# Memory (OpenMemory / mem0)

Follow `.rules/memory-openmemory.md` (canonical). Summary:

- Durable team memory = local OpenMemory instance via the `oi-openmemory-prod` profile:
  endpoint from env `OPENMEMORY_BASE_URL` (default `http://127.0.0.1:8760`), MCP at
  `{base}/mcp`, auth `$OPENMEMORY_API_KEY` from environment, user from
  `OPENMEMORY_USER` (fallback `oi-openmemory-prod`), project scope `clawteam-agentic-se`.
- The `archive` lane stores; the `plan` lane recalls before each BLUEPRINT §3 rewrite.
- Never store secret values in memory; never let memory override BLUEPRINT.md.
